{"alias":"/schools/safeschools/healthed/nurseresources/carecoordination","title":"Guidelines for School Health Services: Health Screenings","changed":"2026-09-11T15:11:39+00:00","before":"<p class=\"text-align-left\"><img alt=\"Health Screenings Web Banner\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"7fab2ef7-d841-4156-a155-ecb193d59f08\" src=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/School%20Health%20-%20Health%20Screenings%20Web%20Banner.png\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; display: block;\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"text-align-left\">Care coordination in schools involves school nurses organizing the care of students by sharing information and maintaining communication among those concerned with the needs and care of students, implementing required health screenings, and creating a healthy environment so students can learn.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"jumbotron jumbotronfluid text-align-center\"><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"46d1318d-3156-412c-be85-8f5e36c9c0a7\" filename=\"School Health Services - Vision Screening Guidelines - 11.25.2025.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/School%20Health%20Services%20-%20Vision%20Screening%20Guidelines%20-%2011.25.2025.pdf\"><strong>Vision Screening: Guidelines for Maine Schools</strong></a></h3>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\">\r\n<div class=\"card\"><img alt=\"two people talking\" class=\"card-img-top\" src=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/CSH%20-%20Screening.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; display: block;\" />\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<h5 class=\"card-title\">Screenings</h5>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/sos/rulemaking/agency-rules/department-education-and-state-board-education-rules\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Chapter 45: Rule for Health Screenings in Maine Schools</a>&nbsp;</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://preventblindness.org/prevent-blindness-childrens-vision-screening-certification-course/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Training for Vision Screeners: National Center for Children’s Vision and Eye Health</a>&nbsp;</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.nasn.org/nasn-resources/resources-by-topic/vision-health\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Vision and Eye Health (NASN)</a>&nbsp;</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://learntoscreen.org/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Training for Hearing Screeners: National Center for Hearing Assessment and Management</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.infanthearing.org/earlychildhood/docs/Recommended-Pure-Tone-Protocol.pdf\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Hearing Pure-Tone Screening Protocol (sample)</a>&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\">\r\n<div class=\"card\"><img alt=\"Card image cap\" class=\"card-img-top\" src=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/CSH%20-%20Forms.jpg\" width=\"100%\" />\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<h5 class=\"card-title\">Sample Forms &amp; Resources</h5>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.infanthearing.org/earlychildhood/docs/ECHO_Hearing_Screening_Diagnostic_Log.xlsx\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Hearing Screening Worksheet</a>&nbsp;</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Hearing%20Screening%20Referral_1.docx\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Hearing Referral Form Sample</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a class=\"file file--mime-application-msword file--x-office-document\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"10eeb6ac-ec2a-48fb-8acf-8257ab653666\" filename=\"School Health Services - Vision Screening Worksheet - 9.11.2026.doc\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/School%20Health%20Services%20-%20Vision%20Screening%20Worksheet%20-%209.11.2026.doc\">Vision Screening Worksheet</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://higherlogicdownload.s3.amazonaws.com/NASN/8575d1b7-94ad-45ab-808e-d45019cc5c08/UploadedImages/PDFs/Practice%20Topic%20Resources/vision_pediatric_screening_referral_form.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Vision Referral Form Sample&nbsp;</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://nationalcenter.preventblindness.org/wp-content/uploads/sites/22/2020/10/4A-How-to-Schedule-an-Eye-Exam.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">How to Schedule an Eye Examination</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://preventblindness.org/think-of-vision-fact-sheets-for-teachers/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Think of Vision Fact Sheets for Teachers/Educators</a>&nbsp;</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://nationalcenter.preventblindness.org/wp-content/uploads/sites/22/2020/10/1A-10-Take-Home-Messages.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">10 Take-Home Messages for Parents</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://nationalcenter.preventblindness.org/wp-content/uploads/sites/22/2020/07/Vision-Screening-Program-Checklist.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Annual Vision Health Program Evaluation Checklist</a>&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"contact-cube\">\r\n<h3><strong>Contact</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Emily Poland, MPH, RN,&nbsp;NCSN&nbsp;</strong><br />\r\n<em>School Nurse Consultant<br />\r\nCoordinated School Health Team Leader</em><br />\r\n<strong>Email</strong>: <a href=\"mailto:emily.poland@maine.gov\">Emily.Poland@maine.gov</a></p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n","after":"<div class=\"doe-hero doe-hero--tall\">\n<p class=\"doe-contact-link\"><a href=\"#contact\">Contact</a></p>\n<p class=\"doe-lead\">Care coordination in schools involves school nurses organizing the care of students by sharing information and maintaining communication among those concerned with the needs and care of students, implementing required health screenings, and creating a healthy environment so students can learn.</p>\n\n</div>\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div class=\"dc-note\"><p><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/School%20Health%20Services%20-%20Vision%20Screening%20Guidelines%20-%2011.25.2025.pdf\">Vision Screening: Guidelines for Maine Schools</a></p></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\">\r\n<div class=\"card\"><img alt=\"two people talking\" class=\"card-img-top\" src=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/CSH%20-%20Screening.jpg\" style=\"display: block\" />\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<h3 class=\"card-title\">Screenings</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/sos/rulemaking/agency-rules/department-education-and-state-board-education-rules\">Chapter 45: Rule for Health Screenings in Maine Schools</a>&nbsp;</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://preventblindness.org/prevent-blindness-childrens-vision-screening-certification-course/\">Training for Vision Screeners: National Center for Children’s Vision and Eye Health</a>&nbsp;</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.nasn.org/nasn-resources/resources-by-topic/vision-health\">Vision and Eye Health (NASN)</a>&nbsp;</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://learntoscreen.org/\">Training for Hearing Screeners: National Center for Hearing Assessment and Management</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.infanthearing.org/earlychildhood/docs/Recommended-Pure-Tone-Protocol.pdf\">Hearing Pure-Tone Screening Protocol (sample)</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">PDF</span>&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\">\r\n<div class=\"card\"><img alt=\"Card image cap\" class=\"card-img-top\" src=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/CSH%20-%20Forms.jpg\" width=\"100%\" />\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<h3 class=\"card-title\">Sample Forms &amp; Resources</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.infanthearing.org/earlychildhood/docs/ECHO_Hearing_Screening_Diagnostic_Log.xlsx\">Hearing Screening Worksheet</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">Excel</span>&nbsp;</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Hearing%20Screening%20Referral_1.docx\">Hearing Referral Form Sample</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">Word</span></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/School%20Health%20Services%20-%20Vision%20Screening%20Worksheet%20-%209.11.2026.doc\">Vision Screening Worksheet</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">Word</span></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://higherlogicdownload.s3.amazonaws.com/NASN/8575d1b7-94ad-45ab-808e-d45019cc5c08/UploadedImages/PDFs/Practice%20Topic%20Resources/vision_pediatric_screening_referral_form.pdf\">Vision Referral Form Sample</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">PDF</span>&nbsp;</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://nationalcenter.preventblindness.org/wp-content/uploads/sites/22/2020/10/4A-How-to-Schedule-an-Eye-Exam.pdf\">How to Schedule an Eye Examination</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">PDF</span></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://preventblindness.org/think-of-vision-fact-sheets-for-teachers/\">Think of Vision Fact Sheets for Teachers/Educators</a>&nbsp;</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://nationalcenter.preventblindness.org/wp-content/uploads/sites/22/2020/10/1A-10-Take-Home-Messages.pdf\">10 Take-Home Messages for Parents</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">PDF</span></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://nationalcenter.preventblindness.org/wp-content/uploads/sites/22/2020/07/Vision-Screening-Program-Checklist.pdf\">Annual Vision Health Program Evaluation Checklist</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">PDF</span>&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"contact\" class=\"contact-cube\">\r\n<h3>Contact</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Emily Poland, MPH, RN,&nbsp;NCSN&nbsp;</strong><br />\r\n<em>School Nurse Consultant<br />\r\nCoordinated School Health Team Leader</em><br />\r\n<strong>Email</strong>: <a href=\"mailto:emily.poland@maine.gov\">Emily.Poland@maine.gov</a></p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\n<p class=\"doe-jump\"><a href=\"#contact\">Contact</a></p>\n<p class=\"doe-top\"><a href=\"#top\">Back to top</a></p>","notes":[],"decisions":[{"id":"headnote","on":true,"label":"Let a statement be a callout, not a heading","why":"1 heading carries a callout class — jumbotron, alert or well — which nobody adds to make something a heading; they add it to make it a box. Set as a heading it is announced as a section of the page and counted into the outline, so a statement becomes a section. It becomes the callout it was asking to be. Not a word changes.","value":"1 heading"},{"id":"filechip","on":true,"label":"Tag a document link with the format it opens","why":"8 links on this page open a file — 5 PDF, 2 Word, 1 Excel — and say nothing about it, while others in the same list carry a tag because their author typed one. The format is read from the file name, so the list stops being half-labelled. No link text changes.","value":"8 links"},{"id":"cardtitles","on":true,"label":"Put the card titles on one level","why":"2 card titles are written at a level copied from an example rather than chosen — h5 on a page whose sections are h2. Only the number changes.","value":"2 titles"},{"id":"deck","on":true,"label":"Use this paragraph as the page description","why":"It is the page’s own opening paragraph, moved into the banner rather than rewritten.","value":"Care coordination in schools involves school nurses organizing the care of students by sharing information and maintaining communication among those concerned with the needs and care of students, implementing required health screenings, and creating a healthy environment so students can learn."},{"id":"banner-graphic","on":true,"label":"Retire the old banner graphic","why":"It repeats the page title in picture form, which the new banner already does in type.","removes":"School Health - Health Screenings Web Banner.png"}],"mechanical":["empty paragraphs removed: 1","drupal entity attrs stripped: 10","target/rel stripped: 20","redundant bold inside a heading removed: 1","images released from inline dimensions: 2","emphasis removed from inside a link: 1","action links marked: 13","space moved out of a link: 1"],"findings":[],"safe":true,"audit":{"alias":"/schools/safeschools/healthed/nurseresources/carecoordination","title":"Guidelines for School Health Services: Health Screenings","changed":"2026-09-11T15:11:39+00:00","words":149,"bytes":5485,"fixes":["empty paragraphs removed: 1","drupal entity attrs stripped: 10","target/rel stripped: 20","redundant bold inside a heading removed: 1","images released from inline dimensions: 2","emphasis removed from inside a link: 1","action links marked: 13","space moved out of a link: 1"],"flags":["no section-header device","legacy jumbotron","h5 card titles"],"contentSafe":true,"headings":[{"l":3,"t":"Vision Screening: Guidelines for Maine Schools","bh":false},{"l":5